'''Humungoopsaur''' is the [[Combinations (Classic)|combination]] of [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]] and [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]]'s DNA. He can only be accessed by using the [[Biomnitrix]].

==Appearance==
Humungoopsaur has [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]]'s general body shape with [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]]'s fingers and spikes and is composed of Goop's slime.

Humungoopsaur wears a white recolored version of Humungousaur's sash across his chest with the [[Biomnitrix]] symbol on it. Floating above him is a white version of Goop's [[Anti-Gravity Projector (Classic)|Anti-Gravity Projector]].

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow">
TEoaE (11).png|Shapeshifting
TEoaE (35).png|Enhanced Strength
</gallery>
Being part-[[Polymorph (Classic)|Polymorph]], Humungoopsaur is capable of shapeshifting like [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]].<ref name="EoaE">''[[The End of an Era]]''</ref>

Being part-[[Vaxasaurian (Classic)|Vaxasaurian]], Humungoopsaur has enhanced strength at a level similar to [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]]'s.<ref name="EoaE"/> He also has the power to increase or decrease his own body size and mass like Humungousaur.{{Refn|[[:File:Humungousaur Fusions Size Alteration.png]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===[[Original Future Timeline|Original Future]]===
*Humungoopsaur first appeared in ''[[The End of an Era]]'', where he and [[Kai Tennyson|Kai]] tried to recapture [[Dr. Animo (Original Future)|Dr. Animo]] who managed to get away and send himself back to [[Animo Crackers|the past]] by using the [[Chronoporter]].

