==Trivia==
*Humungoopsaur's [[Anti-Gravity Projector (Classic)|Anti-Gravity Projector]] is shaped similarly to [[Goop (Classic)|Goop]]'s in '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]'''.
**Coincidentally, the spikes on Humungoopsaur's head and shoulders are similar to Goop's design in those same shows.
*Humungoopsaur's voice is the same as [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]]'s in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.
*Humungoopsaur was the last alien to debut in the Classic Continuity.
*Humungoopsaur had concept art drawn by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]].{{Refn|[[:File:Humungoopsaur Concept Art by Tom Perkins.png]]|group = TNP}}

